# SAUNA alone, the Corrigida's controls screen: up from the start (a dump at 500),
# the game gets nothing until a key: D at 1000 takes the screen down and is not a
# move (the READY second follows, then Pacman runs left), and the window closed
# at 4000 reports the peanuts of 2 s of running (7 of them, +700) and the loss's
# -1000: `lost -200`. A game that had run under the screen, or taken the D, would
# show another score.
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame sauna --headless --ms 5000 --fix all --input tools/play/sauna-corrigida-controls.input
500 dump controls
1000 key d
2500 dump play
4000 close
4500 result lost -200
